// two diverging payloads against it with Magnific. The exploded cover
// had read glossy, warm and thick with an amber LED: the accepted
// payload is Seedream 4.5 seed 9026, accepted after four submissions
// (two Mystic attempts failed on a garbled wordmark tail and blank
